ext-[26px] font-black leading-tight text-stone-900">फळछाटणी</h2><ol class="space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 border-b border-stone-100 pb-3 last:border-0"><span class="grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-stone-900 text-[15px] font-black text-white">१</span><span class="text-[18px] font-semibold leading-snug text-stone-800">काड्या ५-६ डोळ्यांवर छाटा</span></li></ol></div></section><section data-testid="day-card" data-card-type="source" class="mx-auto flex min-h-full w-full max-w-md snap-start snap-always flex-col gap-3 px-4 py-4"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3 rounded-[28px] bg-white p-4 shadow-sm"><div class="flex gap-2"><span class="inline-flex min-h-[28px] items-center rounded-full px-3 text-[13px] font-extrabold" style="background:#F5F5F4;color:#44403C">कुणाचं, कुठलं</span></div><h2 class="text-[26px] font-black leading-tight text-stone-900">फळछाटणी</h2><div data-testid="line-made-by" class="rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 px-3 py-2"><p class="text-[13px] font-extrabold text-stone-500">कुणी बनवलं</p><p class="text-[18px] font-bold">संस्था · चाचणी संस्था</p></div><div data-testid="line-source" class="rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 px-3 py-2"><p class="text-[13px] font-extrabold text-stone-500">स्रोत</p><p class="text-[18px] font-bold">चाचणी पुस्तिका · ३</p></div><div data-testid="line-checked-by" class="rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 px-3 py-2"><p class="text-[13px] font-extrabold text-stone-500">कुणी तपासलं</p><p class="text-[18px] font-bold">तपासनीस</p></div><p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-stone-500">स्रोतात लिहिलेलं</p></div></section>"`;
